@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Verified WASM workflow routing (issue #357)

start
:Classify change;
if (Manual dispatch?) then (yes)
  :Full verification;
elseif (Only allowlisted ordinary docs\n(exact-diff rules)?) then (yes)
  :Documentation checks\n(no WASM build);
else (no)
  :Full verification:\nVerify WASM (current) /\nVerify WASM (frontend-pin);
endif
:Verification result
(always runs; must be green to merge);
stop
@enduml
